{"seq":3,"slug":"volumes-and-persistence","title":"数据卷与持久化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/docker-compose/volumes-and-persistence","wordCount":974,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据卷与持久化\">数据卷与持久化</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>容器的可写层是临时的——容器删除后数据随之消失。持久化依赖三类挂载，按用途区分：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>命名数据卷（Named Volume）</strong>：由 Docker 管理，生命周期独立于容器，是生产环境的推荐方案。</li>\n<li><strong>绑定挂载（Bind Mount）</strong>：直接映射宿主机目录，是开发环境源码同步的首选。</li>\n<li><strong>tmpfs</strong>：存储在内存中，容器停止即清除，用于敏感临时数据。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>在此基础上，数据卷可标记为 <code>external</code> 防止 <code>down -v</code> 误删，并通过 tar 快照或数据库逻辑备份实现保护。选择依据是持久性、性能与安全性的需求。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"容器数据持久化问题\">容器数据持久化问题</h2><p>容器的文件系统是临时的——容器删除后，可写层中的所有数据随之消失。数据卷（Volume）是 Docker 提供的持久化存储机制，独立于容器生命周期，确保数据在容器重建后依然存在。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 无数据卷&#10;        C1[容器 v1] --&gt;|删除| LOST[数据丢失]&#10;        C2[容器 v2] --&gt;|全新启动| EMPTY[空数据]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 使用数据卷&#10;        C3[容器 v1] --&gt; VOL[(数据卷)]&#10;        C3 --&gt;|删除| C4[容器 v2]&#10;        C4 --&gt; VOL&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 无数据卷\n        C1[容器 v1] --&gt;|删除| LOST[数据丢失]\n        C2[容器 v2] --&gt;|全新启动| EMPTY[空数据]\n    end\n    subgraph 使用数据卷\n        C3[容器 v1] --&gt; VOL[(数据卷)]\n        C3 --&gt;|删除| C4[容器 v2]\n        C4 --&gt; VOL\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>存储类型</th>\n<th>生命周期</th>\n<th>性能</th>\n<th>可移植性</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>容器可写层</td>\n<td>随容器删除</td>\n<td>较差</td>\n<td>不可移植</td>\n<td>临时文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>命名数据卷</td>\n<td>独立于容器</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>可备份</td>\n<td>数据库、持久状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>绑定挂载</td>\n<td>宿主机目录</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>依赖路径</td>\n<td>开发时源码同步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>tmpfs</td>\n<td>内存中</td>\n<td>最优</td>\n<td>不持久</td>\n<td>敏感临时数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"命名数据卷\">命名数据卷</h2><p>命名数据卷（Named Volume）由 Docker 管理，存储在宿主机的 <code>/var/lib/docker/volumes/</code> 目录下。它是生产环境推荐的持久化方案。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"services:&#10;  postgres:&#10;    image: postgres:16-alpine&#10;    volumes:&#10;      - pgdata:/var/lib/postgresql/data&#10;    environment:&#10;      POSTGRES_DB: myapp&#10;      POSTGRES_USER: admin&#10;      POSTGRES_PASSWORD_FILE: /run/secrets/db_password&#10;    secrets:&#10;      - db_password&#10;&#10;  redis:&#10;    image: redis:7-alpine&#10;    volumes:&#10;      - redis-data:/data&#10;    command: redis-server --appendonly yes&#10;&#10;volumes:&#10;  pgdata:&#10;    driver: local&#10;  redis-data:&#10;    driver: local\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">services</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  postgres</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">postgres:16-alpine</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    volumes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pgdata:/var/lib/postgresql/data</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    environment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      POSTGRES_DB</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">myapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      POSTGRES_USER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">admin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      POSTGRES_PASSWORD_FILE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/run/secrets/db_password</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    secrets</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">db_password</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  redis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">redis:7-alpine</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    volumes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">redis-data:/data</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    command</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">redis-server --appendonly yes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">volumes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pgdata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    driver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">local</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  redis-data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    driver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">local</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"docker volume ls&#10;&#10;docker volume inspect pgdata&#10;&#10;docker volume create --driver local \\&#10;  --opt type=none \\&#10;  --opt o=bind \\&#10;  --opt device=/mnt/ssd/pgdata \\&#10;  fast-pgdata\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> volume</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ls</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> volume</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> inspect</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pgdata</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> volume</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> create</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --driver</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> local</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --opt</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> type=none</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --opt</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> o=bind</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --opt</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> device=/mnt/ssd/pgdata</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  fast-pgdata</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据卷选项</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>driver</td>\n<td>存储驱动</td>\n<td>local, nfs, s3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>driver_opts</td>\n<td>驱动选项</td>\n<td>type, o, device</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>labels</td>\n<td>元数据标签</td>\n<td>com.example.env=prod</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>external</td>\n<td>使用外部已存在的卷</td>\n<td>external: true</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 使用 <code>external: true</code> 可以引用已存在的数据卷，避免 <code>docker compose down -v</code> 意外删除生产数据。对于关键数据（如数据库），强烈建议使用外部数据卷。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"绑定挂载\">绑定挂载</h2><p>绑定挂载（Bind Mount）将宿主机的目录或文件直接挂载到容器中。它是开发环境中实现源码同步的首选方案。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"services:&#10;  api:&#10;    build: ./api&#10;    volumes:&#10;      - ./api/src:/app/src:cached&#10;      - ./api/package.json:/app/package.json:ro&#10;      - /app/node_modules&#10;    command: [&#39;npx&#39;, &#39;nodemon&#39;, &#39;src/index.js&#39;]&#10;&#10;  frontend:&#10;    build: ./web&#10;    volumes:&#10;      - ./web/src:/app/src:cached&#10;      - /app/node_modules&#10;    ports:&#10;      - &#39;5173:5173&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">services</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  api</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    build</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">./api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    volumes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">./api/src:/app/src:cached</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">./api/package.json:/app/package.json:ro</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/app/node_modules</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    command</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'npx'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'nodemon'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'src/index.js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  frontend</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    build</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">./web</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    volumes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">./web/src:/app/src:cached</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/app/node_modules</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    ports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'5173:5173'</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;宿主机&quot;&#10;        SRC[./api/src]&#10;        PKG[./api/package.json]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;容器&quot;&#10;        CSRC[&quot;/app/src&quot;]&#10;        CPKG[&quot;/app/package.json&quot;]&#10;        NM[&quot;/app/node_modules&lt;br/&gt;匿名卷&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    SRC --&gt;|双向同步| CSRC&#10;    PKG --&gt;|只读挂载| CPKG\">graph LR\n    subgraph \"宿主机\"\n        SRC[./api/src]\n        PKG[./api/package.json]\n    end\n    subgraph \"容器\"\n        CSRC[\"/app/src\"]\n        CPKG[\"/app/package.json\"]\n        NM[\"/app/node_modules&lt;br/&gt;匿名卷\"]\n    end\n    SRC --&gt;|双向同步| CSRC\n    PKG --&gt;|只读挂载| CPKG</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>挂载选项</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>macOS 推荐</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>默认</td>\n<td>完全一致性</td>\n<td>性能一般</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>:cached</td>\n<td>宿主机优先</td>\n<td>推荐开发使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>:delegated</td>\n<td>容器优先</td>\n<td>构建输出目录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>:ro</td>\n<td>只读挂载</td>\n<td>配置文件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"数据备份与恢复\">数据备份与恢复</h2><p>数据卷的备份与恢复是运维的关键操作。Docker 提供多种备份策略。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"docker run --rm \\&#10;  -v pgdata:/source:ro \\&#10;  -v $(pwd)/backups:/backup \\&#10;  alpine tar czf /backup/pgdata-$(date +%Y%m%d).tar.gz -C /source .&#10;&#10;docker run --rm \\&#10;  -v pgdata:/target \\&#10;  -v $(pwd)/backups:/backup \\&#10;  alpine sh -c &quot;cd /target &amp;&amp; tar xzf /backup/pgdata-20260401.tar.gz&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --rm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -v</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pgdata:/source:ro</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pwd</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/backups:/backup</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  alpine</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tar</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> czf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /backup/pgdata-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">date</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> +%Y%m%d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.tar.gz</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -C</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /source</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --rm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -v</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pgdata:/target</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pwd</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/backups:/backup</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  alpine</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> sh</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -c</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"cd /target &#x26;&#x26; tar xzf /backup/pgdata-20260401.tar.gz\"</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"services:&#10;  db-backup:&#10;    image: postgres:16-alpine&#10;    volumes:&#10;      - ./backups:/backups&#10;    environment:&#10;      PGHOST: postgres&#10;      PGUSER: admin&#10;      PGPASSWORD_FILE: /run/secrets/db_password&#10;    command: &gt;&#10;      sh -c &#39;pg_dump -Fc myapp &gt; /backups/myapp-$$(date +%Y%m%d_%H%M%S).dump&#39;&#10;&#10;    depends_on:&#10;      postgres:&#10;        condition: service_healthy&#10;    profiles:&#10;      - backup\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">services</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  db-backup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">postgres:16-alpine</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    volumes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">./backups:/backups</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    environment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      PGHOST</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">postgres</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      PGUSER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">admin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      PGPASSWORD_FILE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/run/secrets/db_password</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    command</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      sh -c 'pg_dump -Fc myapp > /backups/myapp-$$(date +%Y%m%d_%H%M%S).dump'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    depends_on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      postgres</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        condition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">service_healthy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    profiles</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">backup</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>备份策略</th>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>恢复速度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据卷快照</td>\n<td>tar 压缩整个卷</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>小数据量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据库逻辑备份</td>\n<td>pg_dump / mysqldump</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>结构化数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据库物理备份</td>\n<td>pg_basebackup</td>\n<td>最快</td>\n<td>大数据量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>持续复制</td>\n<td>Litestream / WAL 归档</td>\n<td>实时</td>\n<td>高可用需求</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>docker compose down -v</code> 会删除所有命名数据卷。在生产环境中执行此命令前务必确认已完成数据备份。建议在脚本中添加确认提示或使用 <code>external</code> 数据卷防止误删。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tmpfs-与安全存储\">tmpfs 与安全存储</h2><p>tmpfs 挂载将数据存储在内存中，容器停止后数据自动消失。适用于存储敏感的临时数据。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"services:&#10;  api:&#10;    image: myapi:latest&#10;    tmpfs:&#10;      - /tmp&#10;      - /run:size=64M&#10;    volumes:&#10;      - type: tmpfs&#10;        target: /app/sessions&#10;        tmpfs:&#10;          size: 128M&#10;          mode: 1777\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">services</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  api</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">myapi:latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    tmpfs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/tmp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/run:size=64M</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    volumes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">tmpfs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/app/sessions</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        tmpfs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">128M</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          mode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1777</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 存储层次&#10;        TMPFS[tmpfs 内存存储&lt;br/&gt;敏感临时数据]&#10;        VOL[命名数据卷&lt;br/&gt;持久化数据]&#10;        BIND[绑定挂载&lt;br/&gt;开发源码同步]&#10;    end&#10;    TMPFS --&gt; |容器停止消失| GONE[数据消失]&#10;    VOL --&gt; |独立生命周期| PERSIST[数据保留]&#10;    BIND --&gt; |宿主机目录| HOST[宿主机文件]\">graph TD\n    subgraph 存储层次\n        TMPFS[tmpfs 内存存储&lt;br/&gt;敏感临时数据]\n        VOL[命名数据卷&lt;br/&gt;持久化数据]\n        BIND[绑定挂载&lt;br/&gt;开发源码同步]\n    end\n    TMPFS --&gt; |容器停止消失| GONE[数据消失]\n    VOL --&gt; |独立生命周期| PERSIST[数据保留]\n    BIND --&gt; |宿主机目录| HOST[宿主机文件]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>存储选择</th>\n<th>持久性</th>\n<th>性能</th>\n<th>安全性</th>\n<th>使用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>命名数据卷</td>\n<td>持久</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>数据库文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>绑定挂载</td>\n<td>持久</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>源码同步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>tmpfs</td>\n<td>临时</td>\n<td>最优</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>会话、密钥缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Docker Secrets</td>\n<td>持久</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>密码、证书</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((数据卷与持久化))&#10;    存储类型&#10;      命名数据卷&#10;      绑定挂载&#10;      tmpfs&#10;    命名数据卷&#10;      Docker 管理&#10;      独立生命周期&#10;      external 防误删&#10;    绑定挂载&#10;      源码同步&#10;      cached 模式&#10;      只读配置&#10;    备份恢复&#10;      tar 快照&#10;      pg_dump 逻辑备份&#10;      持续复制&#10;    安全存储&#10;      tmpfs 内存&#10;      Docker Secrets\">mindmap\n  root((数据卷与持久化))\n    存储类型\n      命名数据卷\n      绑定挂载\n      tmpfs\n    命名数据卷\n      Docker 管理\n      独立生命周期\n      external 防误删\n    绑定挂载\n      源码同步\n      cached 模式\n      只读配置\n    备份恢复\n      tar 快照\n      pg_dump 逻辑备份\n      持续复制\n    安全存储\n      tmpfs 内存\n      Docker Secrets</pre><ul>\n<li>容器可写层是临时的，生产数据必须使用<strong>命名数据卷</strong>持久化。</li>\n<li>开发环境使用<strong>绑定挂载</strong>实现源码的实时同步，macOS 上推荐 <code>:cached</code> 模式提升性能。</li>\n<li>关键数据的数据卷应标记为 <code>external: true</code>，防止 <code>docker compose down -v</code> 误删。</li>\n<li>数据库备份应结合逻辑备份（pg_dump）和数据卷快照（tar），建立定期自动备份机制。</li>\n<li>敏感临时数据使用 <strong>tmpfs</strong> 存储在内存中，容器停止后自动清除。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数据卷与持久化","id":"数据卷与持久化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"容器数据持久化问题","id":"容器数据持久化问题"},{"level":2,"text":"命名数据卷","id":"命名数据卷"},{"level":2,"text":"绑定挂载","id":"绑定挂载"},{"level":2,"text":"数据备份与恢复","id":"数据备份与恢复"},{"level":2,"text":"tmpfs 与安全存储","id":"tmpfs-与安全存储"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多服务编排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/docker-compose/multi-service-orchestration"},"next":{"title":"开发工作流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/docker-compose/development-workflows"}}